B.bf2=new A.F("Colonize"," a province whose people are of another culture or religion: your settlers make them your own in 5 turns, for gold (more for a crowded province).")
B.aIc=new A.F(B.K,B.a8)
B.bf3=new A.F("Recruit"," in a province of yours with a Barracks. Soldiers cost gold and manpower, and each people fields its own kinds of troops.")
